#: MODEL_SYSTEM.md:1
msgid ""
"Model System - The Dissociation of Nitrate Anion at its Triplet State in an "
"Aqueous Solution"
msgstr "モデル系：水溶液中の Triplet State における Nitrate Anion の Dissociation"

#: MODEL_SYSTEM.md:3
msgid ""
"Nitrate anion ($\\mathrm{NO_3^-}$) in aerosol particles is an essential sink"
" of nitrogen oxide species (NOx). Its photodissociation is a "
"'renoxification' process, which converts nitrate anion solvated in water or "
"deposited on surfaces back into NOx to the atmosphere. The dissociation of "
"nitrate anion at its triplet state can follow two channels:"
msgstr ""
"Aerosol Particles 中の Nitrate Anion（$\\mathrm{NO_3^-}$）は、Nitrogen Oxide "
"Species（NOx）の重要な Sink である。その Photodissociation は、水に溶媒和した、または表面に付着した Nitrate "
"Anion を大気中の NOx に戻す Renoxification 過程である。Triplet State の Nitrate Anion "
"は、次の2つの Channels に沿って Dissociation できる。"

#: MODEL_SYSTEM.md:14
msgid ""
"Despite the well-studied macroscopic kinetics of the two channels, the "
"microscopic details and their connection to the thermodynamics and kinetics "
"of the dissociation are still inconclusive. Previous experiments have shown "
"that nitrate anion photodissociation in aqueous solutions has a low quantum "
"yield of ~ 1%. We previously employed _ab initio_ molecular dynamics "
"simulations at the level of density functional theory with multiple walkers "
"metadynamics to explore the two channels in an aqueous solution to unravel "
"the atomistic and electronic structure details. We located a solvation cage "
"complex that can be identified as a meta-stable state that requires "
"additional thermal energy to complete the dissociation of the N-O bond at "
"the triplet state. This meta-stable state allows the photo fragments to "
"recombine or deactivate through non-radiative processes. In this tutorial, a"
" machine learning interatomic potential was trained based on the first-"
"principles data to demonstrate how to perform multiple walkers metadynamics."
msgstr ""
"2つの Channels の巨視的な Kinetics はよく研究されているが、微視的な詳細や、Dissociation の "
"Thermodynamics・Kinetics との関係は、まだ明確でない。過去の実験では、水溶液中の Nitrate Anion の "
"Photodissociation は Quantum Yield が約1%と低いことが示されている。私たちは以前、Density Functional"
" Theory 水準の _ab initio_ MD と Multiple Walkers Metadynamics を用い、水溶液中の2つの "
"Channels を探索して、原子レベルおよび Electronic Structure の詳細を調べた。その結果、Triplet State で "
"N-O Bond の Dissociation を完了するには追加の熱エネルギーを必要とする、Metastable State に相当する "
"Solvation Cage Complex が見つかった。この状態では Photofragments が再結合したり、Non-radiative "
"Processes で Deactivation したりできる。このチュートリアルでは、First-principles データから Machine "
"Learning Interatomic Potential を学習し、Multiple Walkers Metadynamics の実行方法を示す。"

#: MODEL_SYSTEM.md:21
msgid ""
"![The schematic representation of the CVs used in the current study. The two"
" CVs, _d_ are _n_ are colored in cyan and orange "
"respectively](/CVs_Picture.png)"
msgstr ""
